{"_id":"6a2ff0092204ffbc59e5a3c8","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"a6HiqhsJJijqObw9pNOqb","description":"# DuckDB\n\nDuckDB is an in-process analytical database designed for fast SQL queries on large datasets stored as files or in memory. It can query CSV, Parquet, and Pandas DataFrames directly with SQL syntax. DuckDB is increasingly used in data analysis workflows as a fast alternative to loading data into a full database system.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"DuckDB Docs","url":"https://duckdb.org/docs/current/clients/python/overview","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb08"},{"type":"article","title":"Introducing DuckDB","url":"https://realpython.com/python-duckdb/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb09"},{"type":"video","title":"Try DuckDB for SQL on Pandas","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8SYQtpSk_OI","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb0a"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:28:57.108Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/a6HiqhsJJijqObw9pNOqb.md"}